WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.762
Soon the ogre's wife left the room.

2
00:00:11.763 --> 00:00:14.524
Jack stayed hidden in the oven.

3
00:00:14.525 --> 00:00:23.891
He watched the ogre.

4
00:00:23.892 --> 00:00:29.958
Jack knew what was about to happen.

5
00:00:29.959 --> 00:00:34.060
First, the ogre's head began to nod.

6
00:00:34.061 --> 00:00:42.774
Then, "Zzz. . . Zzz . . . Zzz . . . "

7
00:00:42.775 --> 00:00:48.280
The whole house shook from the snoring.

8
00:00:48.281 --> 00:01:01.960
Jack slipped out of the oven.

9
00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:05.822
Moving quickly, he grabbed the hen.

10
00:01:05.823 --> 00:01:08.568
Then he raced for the door.

11
00:01:08.569 --> 00:01:11.048
Jack stayed very quiet.

12
00:01:11.049 --> 00:01:13.378
But the hen didn't stay quiet.

13
00:01:13.379 --> 00:01:16.227
Instead it made a lot of noise.

14
00:01:16.228 --> 00:01:18.904
Cackle! Cackle! Cackle!

15
00:01:18.905 --> 00:01:22.941
The ogre woke up.

16
00:01:22.942 --> 00:01:27.125
He wiped his eyes.

17
00:01:27.126 --> 00:01:31.287
Jack darted behind the door.

18
00:01:31.288 --> 00:01:35.322
The ogre stared at the empty table in surprise.

19
00:01:35.323 --> 00:01:44.816
"Wife!" he roared. "Get in here at once!"

20
00:01:44.817 --> 00:01:49.794
She ran into the room. "What's wrong, dear?"

21
00:01:49.795 --> 00:01:55.553
"My golden hen!" the ogre cried. "It's gone!

22
00:01:55.554 --> 00:01:58.358
Who took my golden hen?"

23
00:01:58.359 --> 00:02:02.171
"Your golden hen?" his wife said.

24
00:02:02.172 --> 00:02:05.987
The ogre’s wife glanced nervously at the oven.

25
00:02:05.988 --> 00:02:16.045
Jack dashed outside, holding the hen tightly.

26
00:02:16.046 --> 00:02:19.703
"Stop, thief!" the ogre yelled.

27
00:02:19.704 --> 00:02:27.120
The ogre and his wife ran after Jack.

28
00:02:27.121 --> 00:02:40.613
But he was too fast for them.

29
00:02:40.614 --> 00:02:44.372
Jack raced down the road toward the beanstalk.

30
00:02:44.373 --> 00:02:47.978
With a flying leap, he jumped on.

31
00:02:47.979 --> 00:02:57.667
And then down, down, down, he climbed.

